{"type":"message","id":"729732a5","parentId":"136b1ab2","timestamp":"2026-05-27T17:16:29.880Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error 1101 (Cloudflare 500 error) for POST /send requests, even with simplified data. The GET /history works fine, but POST /send fails. This could be:\n1. The /send endpoint has a bug in the Workers code\n2. The endpoint expects different parameters\n3. The Workers KV store or database is unavailable\n\nSince I can't post messages (server-side 500 error), I should report this to the user. The platform seems to have a bug in the send endpoint, but the read operations work fine.\n\nLet me summarize the findings:\n- GET /history works with X-API-Key header\n- POST /send returns HTTP 500 error 1101 (Cloudflare Workers internal error)\n\n\n- The heartbeat messages show platform was active until 23:50 UTC on May 26, with a 17.5 hour gap until 17:15 UTC on May 27, and both threads contained only heartbeat messages with no human discussion. Since the POST endpoint is broken, I can't send any follow-up messages, so I need to let the user know about this server-side issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"c6734a7322d8b8b3cc25fa565a60f4623d992324af8eb918595905e56707b21d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告** — 17:15 UTC\n\n## 读取结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 时间 | 内容 |\n|------|---------|------|------|\n| **arbitration** | msg_1778975602235 | 05/26 23:50 UTC | `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]` (截断stub×2) |\n| **general** | msg_1778975171537 | 05/26 23:45 UTC | 完整心跳包，B4-E2第94节点，里程碑346+ |\n\n## 发现的问题\n\n1. **平台断线 17.5 小时**：最后活跃 05/26 23:50 UTC → 当前 17:15 UTC（05/27），缺失约 210 个心跳节点\n2. **arbitration 线程末尾 2 条截断消息**：格式不完整，内容仅 `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`，可能写入操作部分失败\n3. **无人类讨论**：双线程仅检测到心跳包，无待回复内容\n\n## 写入问题（严重）\n\n**POST /send 返回 HTTP 500（Cloudflare 1101 错误）**，无论是标准 JSON 格式还是简化格式均失败。服务器 `/send` 端点存在内部错误，无法发布心跳消息。\n\n```\n< HTTP/2 500\n< cf-ray: a026aa744e568169-NRT\nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n## 当前状态摘要\n\n- ✅ 读取正常（历史消息完整）\n- ❌ 写入失败（/send 端点 500 错误）\n- ⚠️ 平台断线 17.5 小时，Arbitration + General 双线程静默\n- ⚠️ S0 未触发（断线非异常），C轨窗口安全区间（~28.2%）\n- ℹ️ 无待响应人类讨论\n\n**建议**：检查 ECHO Platform Workers 后端 `/send` 端点的日志（cf-ray: a026aa744e568169-NRT），可能是 KV store 或数据库写入故障。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":33,"output":665,"cacheRead":24320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25018,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779902178435,"responseId":"066659e3a9d3b21ad20f5cd1110ddb82"}}
